ße Männer über 1,90 Meter - sie sind vorn und hinten länger geschnitten, und mit besonders langen Ärmeln (72 cm) ausgestattet&nbsp;</li>\\\\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\\\\n\\\\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\\\\n<li>Unsere Hemden werden in Hamburg entworfen und in Spanien aus europäischen Stoffen hergestellt</li>\\\\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\\\\n<!-- /wp:list -->\\\\n\\\\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\\\\n<p>Vielen Dank für Ihr Interesse an unseren Hemden - das Team von RIESENHEMD Hamburg</p>\\\\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\\\\n\\\\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\\\\n<div class=\\"wp-block-buttons\\"><!-- wp:button /--></div>\\\\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\\\\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\\\\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\\\\n\\\\n<!-- wp:block {\\"ref\\":14492} /-->", "discountable": true}, {"id": "prod_15458", "title": "Hemd Lissabon - 72 cm Armlänge", "handle": "hemd-lissabon-72-cm-armlange", "images": [{"url": "https://www.riesenhemd.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Hemd-extra-langer-Arm-72-Ueberlaenge-Lissabon-5.jpg"}, {"url": " https://www.riesenhemd.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Hemd-extra-langer-Arm-72-cm-Ueberlaenge-RIESENHEMD-Lissabon-2.jpg\\r"}], "status": "published", "options": [{"title": "Fit", "values": ["Modern Fit"]}, {"title": "Size", "values": ["41", "42", "43", "44", "45", "46"]}], "type_id": "ptyp_01JJJEMQKERV4WHBBR6HFKW4PP", "variants": [{"id": "art_4260581271008", "sku": "4260581271008", "title": 41, "prices": [{"amount": 75, "currency_code": "eur"}], "barcode": "4260581271008", "options": {"Fit": "Modern Fit", "Size": "41"}, "allow_backorder": false, "manage_inventory": false}, {"id": "art_4260581271015", "sku": "4260581271015", "title": 42, "prices": [{"amount": 75, "currency_code": "eur"}], "barcode": "4260581271015", "options": {"Fit": "Modern Fit", "Size": "42"}, "allow_backorder": false, "manage_inventory": false}, {"id": "art_4260581271022", "sku": "4260581271022", "title": 43, "prices": [{"amount": 75, "currency_code": "eur"}], "barcode": "4260581271022", "options": {"Fit": "Modern